---
// RecognitionSection.astro — 4 pain points
---
<section class="fade-up">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-label">If this is familiar</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">You have built a life here. Some part of you hasn't quite arrived yet.</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">The move is done, or the holiday has finally started — and your body hasn't caught up. The nervous system is still running at the old speed.</p>
    <div class="recog-grid">
      <div class="recog"><div class="recog-num">01</div><p>You're anxious for no single reason, wired and tired at the same time, and you can't seem to switch off — even on the terrace, even at the sea.</p></div>
      <div class="recog"><div class="recog-num">02</div><p>You sleep badly — after the flight, after the move, or just lately — and wake already tired.</p></div>
      <div class="recog"><div class="recog-num">03</div><p>You want something private and unhurried — not a spa add-on, not a group class, not another appointment in French you have to translate in your head.</p></div>
      <div class="recog"><div class="recog-num">04</div><p>You're carrying more than you have places to set down — a company, a family abroad, a household in a country that isn't yours yet.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
